# 🏗 Architecture Philosophy

## Start Monolithic — Design Modular

This is the key distinction.

You are NOT building:

* microservices
* multiple repos
* separate APIs
* distributed infrastructure

You ARE building:

* a single deployable application
* internally modularized
* domain-oriented
* future-extractable if needed

That gives you:

✔ simple deployment
✔ shared database
✔ centralized auth
✔ easier debugging
✔ faster feature delivery
✔ lower hosting costs
✔ future scalability path

