# 🧱 PHASE 1 — FOUNDATION (CRITICAL)

## 🎯 Objective

Create a production-grade foundation BEFORE features.

Most beginner projects fail because they:

* build features first
* architecture second

You should do the opposite.

---

# 🛠 Recommended Stack

## Backend

* Laravel 12
* PHP 8.3+
* MySQL 8+

## Frontend

* Vue 3
* Inertia.js
