# ✅ Why This Stack Is Correct

## Laravel + Inertia Advantages

Compared to separate SPA/API architecture:

| Inertia Stack         | Separate SPA/API          |
| --------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Simpler auth          | Complex token flow        |
| Faster development    | More boilerplate          |
| Easier deployment     | Multiple deployments      |
| Shared routing        | API versioning complexity |
| SEO-friendly possible | Extra SSR setup           |
| Easier for solo dev   | Higher cognitive load     |

For your current goals, Inertia is objectively the better choice.

