# ❌ What NOT To Add Early

Avoid these until you actually need them:

## Infrastructure

* Redis clusters
* Kubernetes
* Docker Compose ecosystems
* Nginx reverse proxy complexity
* Multi-server architecture

## Application Complexity

* CQRS
* Event sourcing
* GraphQL
* Microservices
* Separate frontend/backend repos

## Why?

Because complexity compounds faster than features.

Your priority is:

> shipping stable software

